  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Zimbabwe. The main outcome areas it contributes to are promoting peace and dialogue  mitigating armed conflict and social tensions and countering the threats to democracy and human rights. The main target groups are community members and community leaders. Through organizing peace committees at community level the project aims to improve processes of Peace Building and Conflict Transformation to enhance interdependence, solidarity and diversity at that community level.</narrative>
  </description>
